                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "E. Employers with facilities and capabilities, which have no employee credit union, agree to make weekly deductions in amounts designated by employees belonging to the UFCW Local Union No. 408 Federal Credit Union who so desire such deductions and shall remit these amounts to such credit union.",
